From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: miogds <miogds@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 16:36:04 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] build: build_ipa.sh builds the app, the framework and the
 project for visionOS

DM_SDK=xros (default iphoneos) now reaches build_ipa.sh too:

- tools/project_sdk.py writes the visionOS project from the iOS templates
  (project.yml, project-framework.yml): every target's platform, the
  deployment target and device family 7. The templates stay the iOS ones;
  build_ipa.sh generates from Gen/project-sdk.yml with this folder as the
  project root, and build_smoke.py uses the same converter.
- xcodebuild takes the SDK and the destination of DM_SDK, and the products
  are read from Release-<sdk>.
- No pipeline archive is made for visionOS unless DM_PSO_GPUS names its
  GPUs: the profile's pso_gpu lists iPhone GPUs.

The game's shader libraries (MSL_IOS) are packed as given, and the shader
build still compiles them for the iPhone SDK only.

Without DM_SDK the script runs the commands it did; the log line the tests
slice the script by is unchanged.

Upstream-Status: fork-only
Reason: visionOS is outside upstream's support matrix: DM_SDK=xros reaches build_ipa.sh (app, game framework, prepared project)
Issue: none yet (miogds/NX2Apple, visionOS evaluation branch; to be filed before this goes to LNPANDY/NX2Apple)

